"entity": {
"name": "Cementir Holding N.V.",
"description": "Cementir Holding NV engages in the production and distribution of white and grey cement, aggregates and ready-mix concrete, and concrete products. It operates through the following geographical segments: Nordic and Baltic, Belgium, North America, T\u00fcrkiye, Egypt, Asia Pacific, and Holding and Services. The firm's products include traditional portland cement, composite portland cement, blast furnace cement, pozzolanic cement, composite cement, white cement, concrete, pre-concrete products, and aggregates. The company was founded on February 4, 1947 and is headquartered in Rome, Italy.",
